      "text": "Teens get tripped up in smuggling attempt, fall on smuggling and possible gun charges. An 18-yr old driver initially fled from agents but stopped when her vehicle was spiked. Agents chased multiple people who bailed from the vehicle, including a 19-yr old passenger who was later identified as a convicted felon.  During the smuggling attempt a firearm was discovered and agents are investigating to determine who possessed the firearm during this illegal alien smuggling event. The driver, passenger, and 3 illegal aliens were arrested.\n\nThe United States Citizens face charges including:\n8 USC 1324 – Alien Smuggling\n\nThe Illegal Aliens face charges including:\n8 USC 1182 Alien Inadmissibility Under Section 212\n\nThis incident remains under investigation and Tucson Sector will continue to collaborate with the U.S. Attorney’s Office to pursue all applicable criminal charges.",
